WEBVTT

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:59.650
The entire fourth sublevel constitutes
a shelter facility.

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:03.450
Furthermore, it was designed to
withstand direct bombardment,

00:02:03.450 --> 00:02:06.580
making it almost impossible to excavate
a path into the facility.

00:02:07.120 --> 00:02:08.990
So, Squad One

00:02:08.990 --> 00:02:09.560
Japan is right now concentrating
all its available resources
will use the loading elevator to get
from floor 1 to sublevel 3.

00:02:09.560 --> 00:02:13.460
Japan is right now concentrating
all its available resources

00:02:13.460 --> 00:02:16.070
on an all-out economic attack
against the United States.

00:02:16.070 --> 00:02:19.400
If their plans go forward, America
will surely fall victim

00:02:19.400 --> 00:02:23.040
to a financial panic of a magnitude
unprecedented in our history.

00:02:23.040 --> 00:02:26.480
Squad Two is the rear guard. Once
Squad One secures the passageway,

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:27.940
then you are to follow them
down to sublevel 3.

00:02:28.910 --> 00:02:30.710
In order to go into sublevel 4 from 3,

00:02:30.710 --> 00:02:34.020
we'll go through the gas
turbine's primary duct

00:02:34.020 --> 00:02:37.140
that's supplying the compressed
airflow into these floors.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:43.760
Squad Two is to destroy the
fuel supply system.

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:47.630
Once the turbine shuts down, you're
to support the infiltration team.

00:02:47.630 --> 00:02:49.930
Squad One, you are to wait for
the turbine to go offline,

00:02:49.930 --> 00:02:51.800
and then destroy the supporting axle.

00:02:51.800 --> 00:02:54.540
Proceed to infiltrate sublevel 4.

00:02:54.540 --> 00:02:57.970
Your main objective is to destroy the
Delft type quantum computer

00:02:57.970 --> 00:03:00.480
set up inside the cryogenic chamber.

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:05.210
However, with the room cooled to
below minus 180 centigrade,

00:03:05.210 --> 00:03:07.680
we don't expect standard firearms
to be able to function.

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:10.090
The destruction of the main
objective in this mission

00:03:10.090 --> 00:03:13.060
will be conducted by Crusader
One employing the EM gun.

00:03:13.060 --> 00:03:16.830
We must prevail in our efforts before
the New York Stock Exchange

00:03:16.830 --> 00:03:22.360
opens at 7:20 Eastern Standard Time,
or 21:20 Japan time.

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:25.370
The enemy's nerve center must
be neutralized by this time.

00:03:25.370 --> 00:03:30.170
300 seconds before the operation
starts, radio silence will begin.

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:33.470
Godspeed.

00:03:49.730 --> 00:03:54.630
It's 8:20. In another hour, the New York
Stock Exchange will open.

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:57.360
Do you really think the US will attack?

00:03:58.400 --> 00:04:00.300
What is our TA Company
doing right now?

00:04:00.300 --> 00:04:02.140
They will arrive here shortly.

00:04:02.140 --> 00:04:03.600
This will be close.

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:33.200
I've run a check on the city's computer,
and found nothing wrong.

00:04:33.200 --> 00:04:34.770
I've just received word that the
TA Company has arrived.
