00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:18.170
Takayama!

00:16:21.280 --> 00:16:24.940
Yes, we won! We beat back America.

00:16:25.550 --> 00:16:27.010
You did good!

00:16:44.530 --> 00:16:47.520
Time flows on.

00:16:48.600 --> 00:16:51.340
I know now that you cannot
deny the past,

00:16:51.340 --> 00:16:54.740
