time comes into being.

00:16:55.510 --> 00:16:58.210
One where you can open up
a new path.

00:16:58.750 --> 00:17:01.080
Opening up a new path for yourself.

00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:04.150
Then you are going to leave us behind.

00:17:04.150 --> 00:17:06.120
I feel ashamed.

00:17:06.120 --> 00:17:07.590
Why?

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.950
Don't you despise us?

00:17:10.490 --> 00:17:13.830
You... At least you thought of me

00:17:13.830 --> 00:17:16.850
