just a means to an end.

00:17:17.430 --> 00:17:19.530
I could feel that coming from you.

00:17:20.070 --> 00:17:21.540
Miharu...

00:17:22.040 --> 00:17:23.500
I must go.

00:17:24.910 --> 00:17:26.370
Miharu!

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:28.910
No, go on.

00:17:29.310 --> 00:17:31.870
I won't forget you, ever.

00:17:32.550 --> 00:17:35.710
I probably won't forget you either.

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:46.890
This just in from Ichigaya. Activity on
the US carriers increasing dramatically.

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:48.960
Do they intend to start
an undeclared war,

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:52.020
and cast aside their carefully maintained
image of respectability?

00:17:52.530 --> 00:17:54.570
Just like seventy years ago,

00:17:54.570 --> 00:17:58.200
